PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Petitioners most respectfully pray that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Pass a decree of divorce by mutual consent dissolving the marriage between Petitioner No. 1 and Petitioner No. 2 solemnised on {marriage_date} at {marriage_place} under {section_citation};
b) Record the terms of settlement annexed hereto and incorporate the same in the decree;
c) {waiver_prayer_if_applicable};
d) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper.

And for this act of kindness, the Petitioners shall ever pray.
